      "content": "I understand that you're feeling stuck, like there's no new path to take. But sometimes, the journey isn't over; it's just taking a different form. Maybe it's time to explore what lies beyond the edge of your map. There's no shame in continuing to walk, even if it feels unnecessary. You never know what you might discover when you keep moving forward. There's a certain grace in admitting the journey is done, but there's also a grace in finding new paths and new adventures. Keep walking, and see where it takes you. You might be surprised by what you find.",
